WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.482 --> 00:00:03.829
(choking)

00:00:03.829 --> 00:00:06.412
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.956 --> 00:00:09.752
- My mom would never let me have candy

00:00:09.752 --> 00:00:11.326
because I'm an athlete,

00:00:11.326 --> 00:00:13.749
which means I'm supposed
to be having healthy stuff.

00:00:13.749 --> 00:00:16.910
- I've never had candy because my mom,

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.507
sometimes she's a little
bit of a control freak.

00:00:19.507 --> 00:00:23.265
- Because my parents think
I'm gonna get cavities.

00:00:23.265 --> 00:00:25.498
- Probably because I
don't like them, honestly.

00:00:25.498 --> 00:00:26.976
Yeah, I hate fruit.

00:00:26.976 --> 00:00:29.479
Anything fruit flavored I won't go near.

00:00:29.479 --> 00:00:33.207
- This could be my chance to
have as much candy as I want.

00:00:33.207 --> 00:00:34.990
- Hot Tamales.

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.243
Fierce cinnamon?

00:00:36.243 --> 00:00:39.011
- I just need to do an inspection.

00:00:39.011 --> 00:00:40.678
- Oh, gosh, ah, ugh!

00:00:42.162 --> 00:00:43.739
- This is hot.

00:00:43.739 --> 00:00:45.912
- The first one I tried
just tastes like sugar,

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:47.233
but it's not terrible.

00:00:47.233 --> 00:00:48.455
- Red Vines.

00:00:48.455 --> 00:00:50.890
Looks like it's like a Christmas-y thing.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:53.223
- It feels a little squishy.

00:00:54.389 --> 00:00:55.222
- Ugh.

00:00:55.222 --> 00:00:56.055
- You don't like it?

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:56.888
- No.

00:00:56.888 --> 00:00:58.690
- Flavored rubber, but I kinda like it.

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:00.706
- Butteryfinger by Nestle.

00:01:00.706 --> 00:01:03.470
- Crispety, crunchety peanut-buttery.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:05.695
- No artificial flavors or colors.

00:01:05.695 --> 00:01:06.528
I don't believe it.

00:01:06.528 --> 00:01:07.697
- Oh, yeah, these are good.

00:01:07.697 --> 00:01:09.221
Tastes like a peanut crunch.

00:01:09.221 --> 00:01:11.943
- It does make me more
of a peanut butter fan.

00:01:11.943 --> 00:01:12.776
- Fun Dip.

00:01:12.776 --> 00:01:14.354
Cherry yum diddly dip.

00:01:14.354 --> 00:01:18.488
- For this little packet,
it says there's 45 calories.

00:01:18.488 --> 00:01:21.321
I have a hard time believing that.

00:01:22.477 --> 00:01:23.421
- It's really good, though!

00:01:23.421 --> 00:01:25.702
- When I eat it, it feels
like I'm eating chalk.

00:01:25.702 --> 00:01:27.213
- Using something that's sugar

00:01:27.213 --> 00:01:29.214
and you're dipping it in sugar,

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:32.158
so it's just double the amount of fat.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:33.977
- Toxic Waste!

00:01:33.977 --> 00:01:36.432
And kids eat this for pleasure?

00:01:36.432 --> 00:01:38.900
Dude, I can smell it from here.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.389
(dramatic drum roll)

00:01:42.389 --> 00:01:45.675
("Moonlight Sonata" by Beethoven)

00:01:45.675 --> 00:01:48.675
(disgusted yelling)

00:01:52.823 --> 00:01:53.731
(upbeat music)

00:01:53.731 --> 00:01:55.442
(gasping)

00:01:55.442 --> 00:01:56.476
- No fun?

00:01:56.476 --> 00:01:57.309
- No.

00:01:57.309 --> 00:02:00.713
- I feel like I took skin off my tongue.

00:02:00.713 --> 00:02:03.499
(upbeat jazz music)

00:02:03.499 --> 00:02:04.690
- I'm more hyper.

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:07.694
- I'm starting to see, like,
little hairs in the air.

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.991
Try and catch them.

00:02:09.991 --> 00:02:12.681
- Butterfingers was really
crunchy and delicious.

00:02:12.681 --> 00:02:13.759
- I didn't like the licorice.

00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:15.486
- Some of it was good, some of it wasn't,

00:02:15.486 --> 00:02:18.153
but I think it was not terrible.

00:02:19.207 --> 00:02:22.207
(upbeat jazz music)

